[I] the identity and the real density
  unit 8-ball volume pi^4/24 = 4.058712126; vol{Q <= n} = (2 pi^4/3) n^4 -> coefficient 64.939394023 vs 64.939394023
  real density coefficient: 4 * (2 pi^4/3) = 259.757576091 = 8 pi^4/3 = 259.757576091
  (8 pi^4/3) / zeta(4) = 240.000000000000 (exactly 8 * 90 / 3 = 240)
  zeta(4) by summation 1.082323233711, pi^4/90 = 1.082323233711
  Z^8, n odd: (pi^4/6) * (90/pi^4) * (16/15) = 16.000000000000 (= 16, so the 2-adic density is 1 at odd n)
  four squares, n odd: pi^2 * (6/pi^2) * (4/3) = 8.000000000000 (= 8)
